SUMMARY:LIVE: DELI GIRLS & RENT (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Flucc
DESCRIPTION:@DECK | Deli Girls is a queer\, anti-racist\, anti-establishment band based in Brooklyn\, NY since 2013. With Deli Girls\, chaos is never gratuitous: it is a way of coming together. Emerging from Brooklyn’s queer counter-culture scene\, the trio led by Dan Orlowski – alongside producer Hatechild and drummer John Bemis – blends punk\, industrial music\, rave and digital hardcore into a sonic tidal wave that is as radical as it is cathartic. On stage\, sweat\, noise and urgency become a shared language\, transforming every gig into a collective outlet\, where raw energy\, sweat and chaos become a true celebration of freedom. Their new album 'Losing State' has being released in May 2026.  DE// Bei Deli Girls ist Chaos niemals sinnlos: Es ist eine Art\, zusammenzufinden. Das Trio um Dan Orlowski\, das aus der queeren Gegenkulturszene Brooklyns hervorgegangen ist\, verbindet – zusammen mit dem Produzenten Hatechild und dem Schlagzeuger John Bemis – Punk\, Industrial\, Rave und Digital Hardcore zu einer klanglichen Flutwelle\, die ebenso radikal wie kathartisch ist. Auf der Bühne werden Schweiß\, Lärm und Dringlichkeit zu einer gemeinsamen Sprache und verwandeln jeden Auftritt in ein kollektives Ventil\, bei dem rohe Energie\, Schweiß und Chaos zu einem wahren Fest der Freiheit werden.  RENT Rent’s sounds refer to industrial ecosystems\, interconnections\, dark landscapes and their stories. At the same time\, it is the processes of sound creation itself that emerge in Rent's compositions: sounds influence each other\, reinforce each other\, cancel each other out\, dissolve and become noise\, sound like the city\, a car alarm for example. Then everything gets lost in the fog again. Together with the Viennese Label Ventil Records Rent released their first LP Kill A Phantom in June 2024 after releasing the EP As Cold As Sunlight in collaboration with TRANSFORMER and Wilhelm Show me the Major Label in 2023. Rent aka Katrin Euller is also part of several artistic collaborations and member of EAERES and EXIT VOID.  VvK 19.- AK 25.- 
URL:https://flucc.at/events/Hnbuas-live-deli-girls/
END:VEVENT
